msgid "This task package installs the Stereo OS developer programs of Sparky Stereo OS: the development files of the edition's stereo stack at the edition's versions (stereo-declare, stereo-layer, gl-stereo, Mesa, KWin, Qt and the Wayland protocols), Debian packaging tools, the stereo proof rig and the virtual display benches, the tools KDE's CI needs locally, and the edition's maintainer skills for humans and local or hosted AI partners; it brings the developer task."
msgstr "安装用于开发 Sparky Stereo OS 的工具，包括本版本立体显示软件栈的开发文件（stereo-declare、stereo-layer、gl-stereo、Mesa、KWin、Qt 和 Wayland 协议）、Debian 打包工具、立体显示验证台与虚拟显示试验台、在本地运行 KDE CI 所需的工具，以及供人员和本地或托管 AI 伙伴使用的维护技能。另会安装开发任务。"

msgid "This task package installs the developer programs of Sparky Stereo OS: KDE's development tools first (KDevelop, Kate and the KDE SDK, the Qt 6 and KDE Frameworks development files, Qt Creator), compilers, debuggers and build systems for C, C++, Rust, Go, Python, Java and the other languages Debian carries, version control, containers and virtual machines, graphics and GPU debugging, the game engines and game libraries."
msgstr "安装 Sparky Stereo OS 的开发工具，首先是 KDE 工具（KDevelop、Kate、KDE SDK、Qt 6 和 KDE Frameworks 开发文件及 Qt Creator）。还包括 C、C++、Rust、Go、Python、Java 和 Debian 提供的其他语言的编译器、调试器和构建系统，以及版本控制、容器、虚拟机、图形和 GPU 调试工具、游戏引擎与库。"

